{%- liquid
  assign mf = product.metafields.custom
  assign drop = mf.collection.value
  assign v = product.selected_or_first_available_variant | default: product.variants.first
  capture state
    render 'av-edition-line', product: product, context: 'state'
  endcapture
  assign sold_out = false
  assign soon = false
  if state contains 'soon'
    assign soon = true
  elsif state contains 'sold'
    assign sold_out = true
  endif
  assign form_id = 'product-form-' | append: section.id
  assign lead_weeks = mf.lead_time_weeks.value | default: 0
  capture label
    render 'av-piece-label', product: product, with_collection: true, numeral_prefix: 'No. '
  endcapture
  assign enquiry = false
  if state contains 'enquiry'
    assign enquiry = true
  endif
  assign commission_url = section.settings.commission_url | default: '/pages/commissions'
  assign wa_text = 'About ' | append: product.title | append: ': ' | append: shop.url | append: product.url
  comment
    What the buyer receives: every photograph shows a full outfit and only the veshti is sold, so the page says so.
    A piece whose length (custom.cloth_length) names an angavastram comes with one.
  endcomment
  assign receive = 'One veshti. The kurta in the photographs is not included.'
  if mf.cloth_length.value contains 'ngavastram'
    assign receive = 'One veshti and one angavastram. The kurta in the photographs is not included.'
  endif
  assign worn_with = mf.worn_with.value
  comment
    Availability is snippets/av-edition-line.liquid's rule; tiles, rows and the list read the same snippet.
    Everyday and Occasional pieces are in stock: sold out at inventory 0 ("continue selling" OFF), then a notify form.
    Commission pieces (custom.tier = commission) are made to order: no price, no order form, an enquiry link instead.
  endcomment
  assign renderable_media = 0
  for m in product.media
    if m.media_type == 'image' or m.media_type == 'video'
      assign renderable_media = renderable_media | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor
-%}
<script type="application/ld+json">{{ product | structured_data }}</script>
<section class="av-product">
  <div class="av-product__gallery">
  <div class="av-product__media" data-av-gallery tabindex="-1">
    {%- if renderable_media == 0 -%}
      {% render 'av-media', ratio: '4 / 5', sizes: '(min-width: 900px) 58vw, 85vw' %}
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- for media in product.media -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign loading_attr = 'lazy'
        assign vt = blank
        if forloop.first
          assign loading_attr = 'eager'
          assign vt = product.handle
        endif
      -%}
      {%- if media.media_type == 'image' -%}
        {% render 'av-media', image: media, ratio: '4 / 5', natural: true, sizes: '(min-width: 900px) 58vw, 85vw', loading: loading_attr, vt: vt, priority: forloop.first %}
      {%- elsif media.media_type == 'video' -%}
        {% render 'av-video', loop_video: media, class: 'av-product__video' %}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
  {%- if renderable_media > 1 -%}<div class="av-product__count av-label" aria-hidden="true"><span data-av-count>1</span> / {{ renderable_media }}</div>{%- endif -%}
  </div>

  <div class="av-product__panel">
    <div class="av-product__title">
      {%- if label != blank -%}<div class="av-label">{{ label }}</div>{%- endif -%}
      <h1 class="av-name">{{ product.title | escape }}</h1>
      {%- if enquiry -%}
      <div class="av-price">On enquiry</div>
      {%- elsif soon -%}
      <div class="av-price">{% render 'av-edition-line', product: product, context: 'tile' %}</div>
      {%- else -%}
      <div class="av-price">{% render 'av-money', price: v.price %}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if settings.av_tax_line != blank and enquiry == false and soon == false -%}<div class="av-label av-price__note">{{ settings.av_tax_line | escape }}</div>{%- endif -%}
    </div>
    <div class="av-product__notes">
      {%- if enquiry -%}
      <div class="av-row__note"><div class="av-label">Availability</div><div class="av-body av-body--s">Made to order, after a conversation.{% if lead_weeks > 0 %} About {{ lead_weeks }} {% if lead_weeks == 1 %}week{% else %}weeks{% endif %} from confirmation.{% endif %}</div></div>
      {%- elsif soon -%}
      {%- assign soon_left = 0 -%}{%- capture soon_left -%}{% render 'av-edition-line', product: product, context: 'remaining' %}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign soon_left = soon_left | strip | plus: 0 -%}
      <div class="av-row__note"><div class="av-label">Availability</div><div class="av-body av-body--s">{% if soon_left > 0 %}{{ soon_left }} {% if soon_left == 1 %}piece{% else %}pieces{% endif %}, held in stock for the opening.{% else %}Held for the opening.{% endif %}</div></div>
      {%- else -%}
      <div class="av-row__note"><div class="av-label">Availability</div><div class="av-body av-body--s">{% if sold_out %}Sold out. We make it again if there is demand.{% else %}In stock. Dispatched from Chennai in six to eight days.{% endif %}</div></div>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- unless enquiry -%}<div class="av-row__note"><div class="av-label">You receive</div><div class="av-body av-body--s">{{ receive }}</div></div>{%- endunless -%}
    </div>

    <div class="av-product__actions">
      {%- if enquiry -%}
        <a class="av-button" href="{{ commission_url }}">Enquire about this piece</a>
      {%- elsif sold_out or soon -%}
        {%- comment -%}
          A customer record, not a contact-form email: Customers → filter by tag "notify-<handle>" (or "opening") to write
          to everyone who asked. Customer forms subscribe the address to email marketing, so consent is recorded.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- form 'customer', id: 'av-notify', class: 'av-notify' -%}
          <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="{% if soon %}opening, {% endif %}notify, notify-{{ product.handle }}">
          {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
            <div class="av-body av-body--s" role="status">{% if soon %}Noted. You will hear from us when it opens.{% else %}Noted. You will hear from us when this piece is back in stock.{% endif %}</div>
          {%- else -%}
            <label class="av-label" for="av-notify-email">{% if soon %}Tell me when it opens{% else %}Tell me when it is back{% endif %}</label>
            <input id="av-notify-email" type="email" name="contact[email]" value="{{ form.email | escape }}" placeholder="Your email" autocomplete="email" required{% if form.errors %} aria-invalid="true" aria-describedby="av-notify-err"{% endif %}>
            {%- if form.errors -%}<div id="av-notify-err" class="av-body av-body--s" role="alert">{{ form.errors | default_errors }}</div>{%- endif -%}
            <button class="av-button" type="submit">Tell me</button>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endform -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <product-form class="product-form">
          <div class="product-form__error-message-wrapper" role="alert" hidden><span class="product-form__error-message"></span></div>
          {%- form 'product', product, id: form_id, class: 'form', novalidate: 'novalidate', data-type: 'add-to-cart-form' -%}
            <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ v.id }}" disabled class="product-variant-id">
            <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
            <button id="ProductSubmitButton-{{ section.id }}" type="submit" name="add" class="av-button product-form__submit"><span>Order this piece</span><span class="loading-overlay__spinner hidden"></span></button>
          {%- endform -%}
        </product-form>
      {%- endif -%}
      {% render 'av-whatsapp-link', label: 'Ask on WhatsApp', text: wa_text %}
    </div>

    {%- comment -%} Price, availability and the button come first; the story of the piece follows (site review, 4 Nov 2026). {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if product.description != blank -%}<div class="av-body av-product__desc">{{ product.description }}</div>{%- endif -%}

    <div class="av-product__accordions">
      {%- if mf.how_made.value != blank -%}
      <details class="av-acc"><summary><h2 class="av-acc__title">How it is made</h2><span class="av-acc__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="av-acc__body av-body av-body--s">{{ mf.how_made.value | escape | newline_to_br }}</div></details>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- unless enquiry -%}
      <details class="av-acc"><summary><h2 class="av-acc__title">Colour and cloth</h2><span class="av-acc__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="av-acc__body av-body av-body--s"><p>Colours on screen can differ slightly from the cloth. Handloom cloth carries slubs, joined threads and small changes in the weave from one length to the next. They do not affect how the piece wears, and no two pieces are exactly alike.</p></div></details>
      {%- endunless -%}
      {%- unless enquiry -%}
      <details class="av-acc"><summary><h2 class="av-acc__title">Shipping</h2><span class="av-acc__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="av-acc__body av-body av-body--s">{%- if section.settings.shipping != blank -%}{{ section.settings.shipping }}{%- else -%}<p>Orders are dispatched from Chennai in six to eight days. Shipping across India is free and insured, and usually takes 2 to 5 working days after dispatch. Expedited shipping is ₹500. For orders from outside India, write to us.</p>{%- endif -%}{%- if shop.shipping_policy.body != blank -%}<p><a href="{{ shop.shipping_policy.url }}">The shipping policy</a></p>{%- endif -%}</div></details>
      {%- endunless -%}
      {%- if enquiry == false and settings.av_returns_line != blank -%}
      <details class="av-acc"><summary><h2 class="av-acc__title">Returns</h2><span class="av-acc__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="av-acc__body av-body av-body--s"><p>{{ settings.av_returns_line | escape }}</p>{%- if shop.refund_policy.body != blank -%}<p><a href="{{ shop.refund_policy.url }}">The full returns policy</a></p>{%- endif -%}</div></details>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if mf.care.value != blank -%}
      <details class="av-acc"><summary><h2 class="av-acc__title">Care</h2><span class="av-acc__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="av-acc__body av-body av-body--s">{{ mf.care.value | escape | newline_to_br }}</div></details>
      {%- elsif section.settings.care != blank -%}
      <details class="av-acc"><summary><h2 class="av-acc__title">Care</h2><span class="av-acc__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="av-acc__body av-body av-body--s">{{ section.settings.care }}</div></details>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- unless enquiry -%}
    {%- comment -%} The questions a buyer asks before ordering (copy draft 4): the kurta, wearing it, the date, seeing it, returning it. {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="av-product__accordions av-product__faq">
      <h2 class="av-label">Before you order</h2>
      <details class="av-acc"><summary><h3 class="av-acc__title">Does it come with the kurta?</h3><span class="av-acc__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="av-acc__body av-body av-body--s"><p>No. You receive the veshti, and the angavastram where the page says so. The kurta in the photographs is not included. A kurta can be made to your measure as a <a href="{{ commission_url }}">commission</a>.</p></div></details>
      <details class="av-acc"><summary><h3 class="av-acc__title">How do I wear it?</h3><span class="av-acc__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="av-acc__body av-body av-body--s"><p>If you would like help tying the veshti, message us on WhatsApp.</p></div></details>
      <details class="av-acc"><summary><h3 class="av-acc__title">Will it reach me before my date?</h3><span class="av-acc__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="av-acc__body av-body av-body--s"><p>Orders are dispatched from Chennai in six to eight days. Delivery across India usually takes 2 to 5 working days after that. For a close date, choose expedited shipping or message us first.</p></div></details>
      <details class="av-acc"><summary><h3 class="av-acc__title">Can I see it before I buy?</h3><span class="av-acc__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="av-acc__body av-body av-body--s"><p>Message us on WhatsApp and we will send more photographs or a short video of the piece. You can also see it at our Chennai studio, by appointment.</p></div></details>
      <details class="av-acc"><summary><h3 class="av-acc__title">Can I return it?</h3><span class="av-acc__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div class="av-acc__body av-body av-body--s"><p>Yes, within 7 days of delivery, if it has not been worn.{% if shop.refund_policy.body != blank %} The full policy is under <a href="{{ shop.refund_policy.url }}">Returns</a>.{% endif %}</p></div></details>
    </div>
    {%- endunless -%}

    {%- if drop != blank or mf.kara_colour.value != blank -%}
    <div class="av-facts">
      {%- if drop != blank -%}{%- assign coll = drop.collection.value -%}<div class="av-fact"><div class="av-label">Collection</div><div class="av-body av-body--s">{% if coll != blank %}<a href="{{ coll.url }}">{{ drop.name.value | default: coll.title | escape }}</a>{% else %}{{ drop.name.value | escape }}{% endif %}</div></div>{%- endif -%}
      {%- if mf.kara_colour.value != blank -%}<div class="av-fact"><div class="av-label">Kara</div><div class="av-body av-body--s">{{ mf.kara_colour.value | escape }}</div></div>{%- endif -%}
    </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if worn_with.size > 0 -%}
    {%- comment -%} The other pieces of the set (product metafield custom.worn_with). Three at most; a swipe rail on phones. {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="av-worn">
      <h2 class="av-label">Worn with</h2>
      <div class="av-worn__tiles">
        {%- for p in worn_with limit: 3 -%}{%- unless p.handle == product.handle -%}{% render 'av-drop-tile', product: p %}{%- endunless -%}{%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</section>
{%- unless sold_out or enquiry or soon -%}
{%- comment -%} Phones only: a slim order bar once the main button has scrolled out of view. The button submits the product form above via its form attribute. {%- endcomment -%}
<div class="av-orderbar" id="av-orderbar" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="av-orderbar__info"><span class="av-orderbar__name">{{ product.title | escape }}</span><span class="av-orderbar__price">{% render 'av-money', price: v.price %}</span></div>
  <button class="av-button av-orderbar__button" type="submit" form="{{ form_id }}" tabindex="-1">Order</button>
</div>
{%- endunless -%}
<script src="{{ 'product-form.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
<dialog class="av-zoom" id="av-zoom" aria-label="{{ product.title | escape }}, photographs">
  <button class="av-zoom__close" type="button" data-av-zoom-close>Close</button>
  <div class="av-zoom__strip" data-av-zoom-strip></div>
</dialog>
<script src="{{ 'av-product.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
{% schema %}
{ "name": "AV Product", "settings": [
  { "type": "richtext", "id": "shipping", "label": "Shipping text (overrides theme setting)" },
  { "type": "url", "id": "commission_url", "label": "Commissions page (enquiry link on commission pieces)" },
  { "type": "richtext", "id": "care", "label": "Default care text" }
] }
{% endschema %}
